
<h1>ADR: {{ service_name }}</h1>

<h2>Status</h2>
<p><strong>Proposed</strong> — auto-generated by TradeForge scaffold</p>

<h2>Context</h2>
<p>
  Service <strong>{{ service_name }}</strong> in domain <strong>{{ domain }}</strong>
  is being provisioned for environment <strong>{{ env }}</strong>.
  Owner: {{ owner }}.
</p>
<p>
  This ADR captures the architectural decisions made at scaffold time.
  Decisions must be reviewed and approved before the service reaches production.
</p>

<h2>Compliance Classification</h2>
<ul>
  <li>SOX Relevant: <strong>{{ sox_relevant }}</strong></li>
  <li>PCI-DSS: <strong>{{ pci_dss }}</strong></li>
  <li>Data Classification: <strong>{{ data_classification }}</strong></li>
  {% if pii_fields %}
  <li>PII Fields: <code>{{ pii_fields | join(", ") }}</code></li>
  {% endif %}
</ul>

<h2>Decisions</h2>
<h3>D1 — Infrastructure</h3>
<p>
  AWS region: <code>{{ region }}</code>.
  Private-subnet-only VPC. No public subnets. All egress via NAT Gateway.
  {% if sox_relevant %}KMS encryption enabled on all S3 buckets (SOX requirement).{% endif %}
</p>

<h3>D2 — Pipeline</h3>
<p>
  Pipeline type: <code>{{ pipeline_type }}</code>.
  Source: <code>{{ source }}</code> → Destination: <code>{{ destination }}</code>.
</p>

<h3>D3 — Compliance Gate</h3>
<p>
  TradeForge compliance scanner runs as a required CI gate.
  Any CRITICAL finding blocks the deploy. SARIF report uploaded to GitHub Code Scanning.
  {% if sox_relevant %}SOX gate job requires zero HIGH+ findings before terraform apply.{% endif %}
</p>

<h2>Consequences</h2>
<ul>
  <li>All infrastructure changes go through Terraform — no manual console edits.</li>
  <li>Secrets are managed via AWS Secrets Manager, never hardcoded.</li>
  {% if pii_fields %}
  <li>PII fields ({{ pii_fields | join(", ") }}) must be masked before any log statement.</li>
  {% endif %}
</ul>

<h2>References</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Jira Epic: {{ epic_key }}</li>
